B = [
('Supreme','North America','1990s-present','streetwear','In the style of Supreme, a flat rectangular label in saturated signal red with heavy white italic capitals in a squeezed, bold sans-serif face, used like a stamp that can sit on any surface and be repeated or tiled as an all-over pattern. Palette of red, white and black with occasional neon or pastel variations and checkerboard or camouflage fills. Crisp screen-print ink, slightly raised and cracked vinyl texture, woven jacquard and chunky embroidery, thick outlines and deadpan minimal wording. Graphics borrow crude photocopy halftones, high-contrast black and white portraits, cartoon figures and found imagery. Smooth heavy cotton, fleece, nylon and glossy enamel finishes keep everything blunt, cool, smug and deliberately ironic.'),
('Salomon','Europe','1990s-present','outdoor','In the style of Salomon, technical, aggressive, engineered mountain-sport design with sculpted, angular silhouettes and sharp protective overlays. Mixed synthetic mesh, welded films, moulded rigid shells and rubberised textures with exposed cord details, all arranged in layered, fast-looking panels. Palette of black, charcoal, warm grey and white with sudden hits of bright red, electric blue, lime, orange or earthy mineral tones in muted colourways. A curved wing-like emblem, drawn as a bold black S shape with a wide capital wordmark, appears in a contrasting colour. Matte and gloss textures sit side by side, with chevron and ribbed patterns, giving a fast, slightly futuristic, precise feel.'),
('Yeti','North America','2010s-present','outdoor','In the style of Yeti, overbuilt, bombproof, American-outdoors design with thick, softly rounded rectangular forms, smooth heavy walls, chunky rubber trims, rope accents and tie-down slots. Double-walled stainless steel and rotomoulded plastic with durable powder-coated matte colour in tan, white, navy, charcoal, seafoam, desert clay, with accents of coral, teal and cream. The logo is a huge, tightly set, wide capital wordmark in white on deep navy or black, sometimes inside a rounded badge or debossed into the surface. Clean minimal surfaces, thick moulded edges, engraved text and a matte, rugged, heavy-duty finish give the sense of something built to last for decades.'),
('Victorinox','Europe','1890s-present','tools','In the style of Victorinox, Swiss precision and functional compactness. Glossy translucent or matte signal red surfaces with a white cross on a shield emblem inlaid near the top, polished stainless steel nested neatly in thin layers with brass-coloured accents. Smooth rounded rectangular profiles with a gently pinched waist and fine laser-etched small text in clean sans-serif capitals. Black polymer, olive, blue, silver and translucent coloured variants appear on tougher or playful versions. Bright signal red against cool silver steel and white, tidy and orderly, with many functions folded into a small body. Packaging uses red and white cards, silver surfaces and thin clear windows with neat technical diagrams.'),
('Columbia Sportswear','North America','1980s-90s','outdoor','In the style of Columbia Sportswear, practical, layered, weather-ready design in bold colour-block panels of red, bright blue, yellow, forest green and black, with contrasting yokes, sleeves and trims. Khaki and sage utility pieces with vented panels, many small zip pockets and tab details. The mark is a stylised mountain peak made of diamond shapes with a bold serif wordmark, embroidered small or woven in a label on a corner. Sturdy nylon ripstop, quilted waterproof outer fabrics, fleece, silver dotted reflective lining, drawcords and chunky zips. Corduroy and plaid trims add warmth. Finishes are matte and sturdy, with a chunky 1990s outdoor fashion attitude.'),
('Canada Goose','North America','2000s-present','fashion','In the style of Canada Goose, extreme-cold expedition design, puffy, boxy, wide-shouldered, protective and rugged. Heavy, down-filled, quilted forms with large padded volumes, a fur-trimmed protective edge, a tall collar, snap-closed storm flaps, flapped patch pockets and a cinched waist. Fabric is dense, matte, slightly rough woven cotton-nylon in black, navy, graphite grey, sand, red or arctic white, with visible baffles. Signature is a round embroidered badge with a white polar map in a blue centre, ringed with red and white lettering. Reflective piping, leather pulls, knit trims, tonal tags and quiet, premium detailing give a serious and wealthy polar feel.'),
('Playmobil','Europe','1970s-present','toys','In the style of Playmobil, small hard plastic forms with oversized round shapes, simple dot marks, a curved smile line, C-shaped curves and standardised blocky, stiffly jointed construction. Bright primary red, yellow, blue and green plus brown, grey and skin tones in a matte to satin finish, with clean moulded seams and thin moulded details. Everything is simplified into cheerful, friendly, clip-together pieces with tiny printed faces and flat painted patterns. The logo is a rounded, lowercase, bold sans-serif wordmark in blue with a smiling curve above it, on a bright yellow or blue graphic field. Packaging uses clear windows and bold colour panels in a cheerful, wholesome tone.'),
('Hot Wheels','North America','1968-1970s','toys','In the style of Hot Wheels, high-energy speed look with sparkling candy-coloured metallic paint in magenta, aqua, lime, orange and gold, and glossy chrome highlights. Exaggerated low, wide, aggressive stance forms with flame and stripe decals, thin red pinstripes and checker patterns. The logo is a bold, italic, flame-edged lettering in yellow and red with a sharp outline and a trail of fire. Graphics use saturated orange, electric blue, red and yellow with swooping loops, speed blurs, cartoon shine marks and starburst flashes. Surfaces are glossy, slick and punchy, with bright orange as a signature accent. Loud, fast, playful and rebellious, with a retro 1970s edge and modern high-gloss polish.'),
('Barbie house style','North America','1960s-present','toys','In the style of Barbie, saturated hot pink dominating everything, accented with turquoise, white, lilac, and soft pastel pink. Glossy moulded plastic and shiny vinyl in sweet, rounded, slim and elegant forms with arched, stylish proportions. The logo is a swirling, hand-drawn-looking script wordmark in white on pink, often with sparkles, hearts, stars and small bows. Patterns include polka dots, gingham, stripes and glitter. Surfaces mix candy gloss, satin, tulle, faux fur, metallic foil and sparkly glitter finishes. Sweet, glamorous and aspirational, with both 1960s retro charm and modern glam variations, all bathed in monochrome pink with white highlights.'),
('Mattel','North America','1960s-80s','toys','In the style of Mattel, bright glossy moulded vinyl and plastic in strong primary red, blue and yellow with a hot pink accent. Rounded friendly forms, chunky heroic shapes with exaggerated proportions and painted details. The emblem is a spiky, starburst-like red circle with a bold white capital wordmark, echoing a stamp or seal. Graphics use bold block lettering with outline and drop shadow, starburst flashes, splashy painted illustration, retro 1970s and 80s cartoon graphics and checker or stripe accents. Surfaces are shiny, smooth, saturated and punchy, with a header-card look in red, white and black. Loud, cheerful, confident fun with a classic toy-aisle attitude.'),
]
